{"id":"wkmm5nc9ia6gze5715wkfp5co","title":"Genie 4：新一代世界模拟模型发布","originalTitle":"Genie 4: A new generation of world simulation","summary":"Google DeepMind 发布了 Genie 4，这是一个新的世界模拟模型，具备前所未有的逼真度和实时互动能力。Genie 4 能够同时生成音频、环境音效和互动对话，并通过 Gemini 模型提供复杂的推理支持。该模型已开始作为研究预览版提供给部分用户测试，计划未来向公众和开发者开放。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Google DeepMind"},"links":{"original":"https://deepmind.google/blog/genie-4-a-new-generation-of-world-simulation/"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-27T16:01:38.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-27T16:36:37.993Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-27T16:36:37.993Z","category":"ai-models","tags":["模型发布","多模态","推理","开源/仓库"],"score":47,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"5fac7c99-b4fc-46bc-ba4a-6856b5f70a8c","title":"Google DeepMind发布Genie 4世界模型，开放AI Ultra订阅者测试"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"5fac7c99-b4fc-46bc-ba4a-6856b5f70a8c","title":"Google DeepMind发布Genie 4世界模型，开放AI Ultra订阅者测试"}],"topics":[{"slug":"reasoning","name":"推理能力"},{"slug":"multimodal","name":"多模态"},{"slug":"open-source","name":"开源生态"},{"slug":"model-releases","name":"模型发布"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fSvyAIO8Klfo","reportCount":5,"additionalSourceCount":4},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}